<title>POLAND: REMAK MAY NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>REMAK MAY NET RISES TO PLN 0.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.91 vs   0.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.32 vs   0.08</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.20 vs   0.01 loss</p>
<p> Sales		    7.63 vs   5.29</p>
